matrisaver (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=low

  * Linux host and packaging (ROADMAP Milestone 3): multi-monitor
    fullscreen playback, an explicit Vulkan-then-GL backend ladder, XDG
    overlay pack discovery, and idle-integration helpers for swayidle,
    xautolock and xss-lock.
  * The upstream changelog is maintained in Keep a Changelog format,
    not Debian format, so it ships beside this one as
    /usr/share/doc/matrisaver/CHANGELOG.md.gz.

 -- @MAINTAINER@  @DATE@
